      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at a ticket for a customer complaining about a shattered ceramic vase. They're demanding an immediate refund. Based on the carrier data and the customer's claim, what's the most efficient way to handle this so we keep the customer happy but also minimize any unnecessary costs for SwiftCart?",
